<title>INDONESIA: Carmanah, Pertamina to sign oil contract.</title>
<headline>Carmanah, Pertamina to sign oil contract.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian state oil company Pertamina will sign a production sharing contract with GFB Resources Indonesia, a wholly owned unit of Carmanah Resources Ltd of Canada, to explore for offshore gas and oil near the Natuna islands, sources in Pertamina said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;We will sign oil contracts on Thursday with several foreign oil companies, including with GFB Resources,&quot; one source said.</p>
<p>&quot;GFB will explore areas offshore North East Natuna,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>He gave no other details.</p>
</text>
